            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, olfactory, poison)\n\n5 feet. The scented candle homunculus's fragrance of lavender is overwhelmingly intense. Any creature other than the homunculus's master who enters the aura must attempt a 15 Fortitude save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is temporarily immune to the homunculus's aura for 24 hours.\n- **Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Failure:** The creature is sickened 1.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is stupefied 1 for 1 round and sickened 1."
